{"id":"093190b59177ac14","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-inverse-image-substitution.md","title":"df-inverse-image-substitution","display":"df-inverse-image-substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-inverse-image-substitution","aliases":["16-df-inverse-image-substitution"],"display":"df-inverse-image-substitution","depends_on":["[[16-df-function]]"],"source":"Section 0.2, p. 12 (PDF 32)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-inverse-image-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-inverse-image-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inverse-image-substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f205978a7c11015b\" href=\"?note=f205978a7c11015b\" title=\"16-df-function\">16-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Section 0.2, p. 12 (PDF 32)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J\">\\(I,J\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(u,I,J)\">\\(\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(u,I,J)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f205978a7c11015b\" href=\"?note=f205978a7c11015b\" title=\"16-df-function\">16-df-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(i)\">\\(u(i)\\)</span> 表示函数图的唯一取值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cap\">\\(\\cap\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cup\">\\(\\cup\\)</span> 为集合论的幂集、交、并；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathcal P(J)\">\\(X,Y\\in\\mathcal P(J)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u^*\">\\(u^*\\)</span> 是下文构造的集合函数，其定义域和值域在公式中指定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nu^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle Y,\\{i\\in I\\mid u(i)\\in Y\\}\\rangle\\mid Y\\in\\mathcal P(J)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(u^*,\\mathcal P(J),\\mathcal P(I))&amp;,\\\\\nX\\subseteq Y&amp;\\Longrightarrow u^*X\\subseteq u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*(X\\cap Y)&amp;=u^*X\\cap u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*(X\\cup Y)&amp;=u^*X\\cup u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*J&amp;=I.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nu^*&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle Y,\\{i\\in I\\mid u(i)\\in Y\\}\\rangle\\mid Y\\in\\mathcal P(J)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(u^*,\\mathcal P(J),\\mathcal P(I))&amp;,\\\\\nX\\subseteq Y&amp;\\Longrightarrow u^*X\\subseteq u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*(X\\cap Y)&amp;=u^*X\\cap u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*(X\\cup Y)&amp;=u^*X\\cup u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*J&amp;=I.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\subseteq J\">\\(Y\\subseteq J\\)</span>，分离公理给出唯一逆像子集，因此函数图定义有完整的存在唯一性。逐元素代入定义给出单调性以及交、并、顶的保持；单调性使它同时成为幂集偏序间的函子。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, §0.2, p. 12（PDF 32）。量词伴随见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"040fbbfdb52f2389\" href=\"?note=040fbbfdb52f2389\" title=\"16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets\">16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"f205978a7c11015b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"f205978a7c11015b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$I,J$ 为集合，$\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(u,I,J)$ 采用 [[16-df-function]]；$u(i)$ 表示函数图的唯一取值。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets","status":"resolved","id":"040fbbfdb52f2389","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Jacobs, §0.2, p. 12（PDF 32）。量词伴随见 [[16-thm-quantifier-adjointness-sets]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I,J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(u,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"u(i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\cap","display":false},{"tex":"\\cup","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in\\mathcal P(J)","display":false},{"tex":"u^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nu^*&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle Y,\\{i\\in I\\mid u(i)\\in Y\\}\\rangle\\mid Y\\in\\mathcal P(J)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Function}_{16}(u^*,\\mathcal P(J),\\mathcal P(I))&,\\\\\nX\\subseteq Y&\\Longrightarrow u^*X\\subseteq u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*(X\\cap Y)&=u^*X\\cap u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*(X\\cup Y)&=u^*X\\cup u^*Y,\\\\\nu^*J&=I.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"Y\\subseteq J","display":false}],"bytes":1363,"backlinks":[{"id":"7977665ec7a5feef","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-268","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-inverse-image-substitution|df-inverse-image-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["f205978a7c11015b","040fbbfdb52f2389"]}